# This repo is authored on Windows and deployed to a Linux VM, so line endings
# have to be pinned. A CRLF in a systemd unit or a shell script fails in ways
# that are genuinely hard to read.
#
# Normalize everything to LF in the repository; Git may still check files out
# as CRLF locally, which is fine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these — they're either binary or must stay byte-exact.
*.pb        binary
*.gz        binary
*.parquet   binary
*.duckdb    binary
